×H£q¹{"reviews": [{"id": "R3GFCY1AZXGZ5L", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "Is not charging anymore", "stars": "1.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on October 13, 2017", "text": "I always recommend this amazing bluetooth speaker to all my friends. But suddenly this week mine stops to work. I tried to charge and even didnt work. Less than 1 year....\nI bought another one and is not charging also. So desappointed.", "source": "amazon"}, {"id": "RL6Z84NM4A4GA", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "Not loud", "stars": "3.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on January 27, 2019", "text": "The sound quality is good with this speaker but my iPhone X is louder than this speaker. If volume is what you need, you'll need a different speaker.", "source": "amazon"}, {"id": "RNDMW4S0A67NQ", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "Bass missing! Good for the price", "stars": "3.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on September 24, 2017", "text": "This is okay for the price tag! But just be aware that the bass is almost non existent. I have a Bose soundlink mini. As compared to Bose, this has just 5% of the bass. Rest all is good.", "source": "amazon"}, {"id": "R2OKI5HABE8BAB", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "Don\u2019t expect long life.", "stars": "1.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on May 27, 2019", "text": "Trash. Operated for one month then broke. Lasted just long enough to be out of warranty.", "source": "amazon"}, {"id": "RACON9ULEUMM2", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "Charging port dies easily.", "stars": "1.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on September 28, 2018", "text": "The day after the return window closed, it stopped accepting a charge. As it\u2019s not heavy enough to be a boat anchor, I suppose I\u2019ll have to send it to the landfill.", "source": "amazon"}, {"id": "R34OY077TIAVHH", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "\"YOU GET WHAT YOU PAY FOR\"", "stars": "3.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on May 16, 2018", "text": "YOU GET WHAT YOU PAY FOR...CHEAP SOUND - MY COMPUTER SPEAKERS SOUND MUCH BETTER AND LOUDER...WELL PACKED - SHIPPED FAST - NICE LOOKING..!", "source": "amazon"}, {"id": "R15J6KOV5259NH", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "very poor quality sound", "stars": "2.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on October 24, 2016", "text": "Not sure what kind of ears the reviewers giving it 5 stars must have, but be careful what you read. Why are there so many unusually detailed, high star ratings of a cheap speaker..? Very odd. It's tinny and weak, very poor quality sound. I didn't have high hopes because it's so cheap, but it literally sounds like a mobile phone or laptop speaker. If sound quality means anything to you then I advise shopping carefully for something better.", "source": "amazon"}, {"id": "R2SZQN9I9ADJA8", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "Nah", "stars": "1.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on July 11, 2020", "text": "Right after the return window closed it stopped charging and constantly disconnects.", "source": "amazon"}, {"id": "R2G14IKPN6TCJM", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "Does its job", "stars": "3.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on March 3, 2019", "text": "It doesn't really seem to get very loud. I bought it for garage workouts.", "source": "amazon"}, {"id": "R1607M5CB5J0ZN", "type": "neg", "site": "amazon", "title": "Little Speaker Little sound", "stars": "3.0 out of 5 stars", "date": "Reviewed in the United States on December 23, 2019", "text": "No low tones", "source": "amazon"}]}                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   